<title>USA: Brazil coffee areas still seen free of cold damage.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee areas still seen free of cold damage.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight in Brazil's coffee growing areas over the next five days, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Low temperatures on Thursday and Friday are seen at 50-65 degrees.</p>
<p>Conditions will remain little changed from Saturday-Monday.</p>
